    "sections": {
        "description": "<p>Sepordeh is Iranian payment company</p>\n<p>activation steps:</p>\n<p>1- get your business merchant code from <a href=\"https://sepordeh.com\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Sepordeh</a></p>\n<p>2- go to your wordpress dashboard</p>\n<p>3- download this plugin</p>\n<p>4- install this plugin and activate it</p>\n<p>5- Go to WooCommerce &gt; Settings &gt; Payments then enable Sepordeh payment gateway</p>\n<p>6- go to manage then put your merchant code</p>\n<p>7- enjoy it 🙂</p>\n",
        "faq": "\n<dt id='this%20is%20an%20official%20plugin%3F'>\nthis is an official plugin?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>yes , you can download it from <a href=\"https://github.com/sepordeh/sepordeh-woocommerce\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">GITHUB</a></p>\n</p>\n\n",
        "changelog": "<h4>2.0.0</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Blocks compatibility</li>\n<li>Support for latest WooCommerce versions</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.4.0</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Optimized performance</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.2.0</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Upgraded to WP HTTP API</li>\n<li>Fixed some payment bugs</li>\n</ul>\n"
    },
